| `r4805000_a_later_splash_meets_what_an_earlier_one_left` | health 20; `1/1` lane 2, `stand-in (1) 0/20 Taunt` lane 3, `stand-in (1) 2/3 Reborn` lane 4 | `CLEAVER` lane 2, `stand-in (2) 5/4 Cleave, Trample` lane 3 | `face_threat` 10. First swing: 4 + 2, and the Reborn body comes back at 1 health. Second swing: the lane-2 unit is gone, 4 over the body. OFF 0. `dealt` 10 after both attack the 0/20. `ready_gap(&passed, HUMAN) == 10.0` |
| `r4805000_a_splash_tramples_over_a_taunt_the_walk_has_passed` | health 20; `{ "def": "stand-in (1) 0/2 Flying, Taunt", "lane": 2, "position": "ATK" }`, `0/9 Taunt` lane 3 | `CLEAVER` lane 3 | The Flying Taunt binds no ground attacker (R783002), so the walk passes it first. `face_threat` 3. OFF 0. `dealt` 3 after an attack on the 0/9, and the 0/2 is off the field. `ready_gap(&passed, HUMAN) == 17.0` |
| `r4805000_a_splash_on_a_unit_without_taunt_spends_the_pool_first` | health 20; backrow `[{ "def": "stinkyscapeplus-042", "faceUp": true }]` (Force Projector, pool 5); `1/1` lane 2, `stand-in (1) 0/3 Taunt` lane 3 | `stand-in (1) 2/4 Cleave` lane 1, `stand-in (1) 6/6 Trample` lane 2 | The 2/4's hit and splash spend 4 of the pool, so the 6/6 deals 5 and tramples 2. `face_threat` 2. OFF 0. `dealt` 2, with the 2/4 attacking first, then the 6/6. `ready_gap(&passed, HUMAN) == 18.0` |
